{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659329292,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","part":{"partID":"prt_1da081a73001yjhNCya61KlM9L","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","messageID":"msg_1da080e6e0013gMP5HcmmUtvrl","type":"tool","id":"wk0mydcye","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"run\":1,\"runId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 1: headless dispatch contract\",\"findingsCount\":8,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All 8 findings are new to the packet: the headless flag set, the closed exit-code taxonomy, the export.json contract and the protocol launch surface had no prior record in this lineage.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: prompt as argument, stdin or file, which flags set model, agent profile, permissions, working directory and turn or time limits, what lands on stdout and stderr, and what are the exit codes on success, provider error, denied tool and timeout?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: prompt as argument, stdin or file, which flags set model, agent profile, permissions, working directory and turn or time limits, what lands on stdout and stderr, and what are the exit codes on success, provider error, denied tool and timeout?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Recovering the --output json schema with strings on the Rust binary\",\"Treating vibe --help as the whole dispatch contract\"],\"focusTrack\":\"headless-dispatch\",\"edgeCase\":\"missing-dependency\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Write\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/cli/launcher.py\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/protocol.py\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/permissions.py\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/scratch/smoke1/stderr.txt\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-14T12:28:40Z\",\"durationMs\":205000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-angle1\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Headless dispatch contract\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Prompt from flag, stdin or --prompt-file\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-002\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Four headless-only limits\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-003\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Agent, model, permission and workdir flags\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Closed exit-code taxonomy 0-4\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"export.json written on every exit\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-006\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Unauthenticated dispatch exits 1 with stderr error\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-007\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"vibe is a Rust binary; Python is app-server and ACP\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-008\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"AgentConfig is the protocol launch surface\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"src-run-export\",\"kind\":\"SOURCE\",\"label\":\"app_server/run_export.py\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter001-001\",\"source\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"target\":\"q-angle1\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter001-002\",\"source\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"target\":\"q-angle1\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter001-003\",\"source\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"target\":\"q-angle1\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter001-004\",\"source\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"target\":\"src-run-export\",\"relation\":\"CITES\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Headless mode is -p/--prompt: prompt from the flag argument, from stdin when the flag carries no value, or from --prompt-file; --workdir sets the working directory and --output selects text, json or streaming.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-002\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Four headless-only limits exist: --max-turns, --max-price (cumulative across root session and subagents), --max-tokens, and --time-limit, which writes the export and exits 3.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-003\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Dispatch knobs cover agent profile (--agent with builtin ask, accept-edits, smart-approve, auto-approve or a ~/.vibe/agents TOML), model alias, approvals (--auto-approve/--yolo, --smart-approve), tool allow/deny lists, trust, extra dirs, worktree and system prompt file.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Exit codes are closed: 0 finished, 1 usage or config error, 2 infrastructure failure, 3 limit or refusal (turn, token, price, deadline, terminated, length, refusal), 4 aborted by the agent-socket server.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"--output-dir writes export.json on every exit with version, effective config, token usage, cost, stop reason and outcome, plus the session journal and each subagent journal.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-006\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"An unauthenticated live dispatch exits 1, leaves stdout empty, prints a keychain notice and 'Error: Missing MISTRAL_API_KEY environment variable for mistral provider' on stderr.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/scratch/smoke1/stderr.txt\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-007\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"The vibe console script execs a bundled 28 MB Rust binary, so headless rendering is Rust-side; the Python package supplies the app server and ACP engines.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/cli/launcher.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-008\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"The protocol launch surface AgentConfig carries headless, workdir, agent, auto_approve, enabled and disabled tools, max_turns, max_price, max_session_tokens, trust_workspace, system_prompt, mcp_servers, client tools and client hooks.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/protocol.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Recovering the --output json schema with strings on the Rust binary\",\"reason\":\"Serde does not emit literal JSON field names in the binary; only two generic fragments were found.\",\"iteration\":1}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating vibe --help as the whole dispatch contract\",\"reason\":\"The help lists flags but is silent on exit codes and the export contract, which only the app server documents.\",\"iteration\":1}\n{\"type\":\"observation\",\"id\":\"obs-iter001-001\",\"packet\":\"angle-1\",\"classification\":\"real\",\"iteration\":1}\n{\"type\":\"invariant\",\"id\":\"inv-iter001-001\",\"label\":\"A governed dispatch must read export.json for outcome and cost rather than parsing stdout, because stdout format is a flag and the export is written on every exit.\",\"iteration\":1}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-001.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"run\\\":1,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 1: headless dispatch contract\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":8,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":1.0,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"All 8 findings are new to the packet: the headless flag set, the closed exit-code taxonomy, the export.json contract and the protocol launch surface had no prior record in this lineage.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: prompt as argument, stdin or file, which flags set model, agent profile, permissions, working directory and turn or time limits, what lands on stdout and stderr, and what are the exit codes on success, provider error, denied tool and timeout?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: prompt as argument, stdin or file, which flags set model, agent profile, permissions, working directory and turn or time limits, what lands on stdout and stderr, and what are the exit codes on success, provider error, denied tool and timeout?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Recovering the --output json schema with strings on the Rust binary\\\",\\\"Treating vibe --help as the whole dispatch contract\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"headless-dispatch\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"missing-dependency\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"Write\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\\\",\\\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/cli/launcher.py\\\",\\\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\\\",\\\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/protocol.py\\\",\\\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/permissions.py\\\",\\\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/scratch/smoke1/stderr.txt\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-14T12:28:40Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":205000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"q-angle1\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"QUESTION\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Headless dispatch contract\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-001\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Prompt from flag, stdin or --prompt-file\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-002\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Four headless-only limits\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-003\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Agent, model, permission and workdir flags\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-004\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Closed exit-code taxonomy 0-4\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-005\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"export.json written on every exit\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-006\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Unauthenticated dispatch exits 1 with stderr error\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-007\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"vibe is a Rust binary; Python is app-server and ACP\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-008\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"AgentConfig is the protocol launch surface\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"src-run-export\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"SOURCE\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"app_server/run_export.py\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/