{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659460187,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","part":{"partID":"prt_1da0a1dd9002drB9AC5Ii62Ckr","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","messageID":"msg_1da0a0e6b001PXCGjNjV285t15","type":"tool","id":"zo1uho1ha","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":2,\"run\":2,\"runId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 2: providers, models and the subscription\",\"findingsCount\":7,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All 7 findings are new: the auth resolution order, the provider/model config surface, the allowed_models roster, the thinking ladder without a CLI flag, the two usage counters and the denial semantics had no prior packet record.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"How does Vibe authenticate (browser sign-in, API key, bring-your-own key), can a dispatch pin deepseek-v4-1-flash-1017 and zai-glm-5-3-flash, how is reasoning effort set, and which usage counter does a Vibe turn draw on?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"How does Vibe authenticate (browser sign-in, API key, bring-your-own key), can a dispatch pin deepseek-v4-1-flash-1017 and zai-glm-5-3-flash, how is reasoning effort set, and which usage counter does a Vibe turn draw on?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Looking for a --reasoning-effort CLI flag\",\"Assuming the built-in catalog can name an OpenCode model id\"],\"focusTrack\":\"providers-and-billing\",\"edgeCase\":\"ambiguous-input\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Write\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/utils/api_keys.py\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/evidence/vibe-config-schema.json\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_billing.py\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_unified_permissions.py\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/protocol.py\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-14T12:30:51Z\",\"durationMs\":131000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-angle2\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Providers, models and the subscription\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-001\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Auth order session, environment, keyring, OIDC\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-002\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Provider config is first-class bring-your-own endpoint\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-003\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Foreign model ids need a provider and model entry\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-004\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"allowed_models is the closed roster\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-005\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Reasoning effort is six levels but not a CLI flag\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-006\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Two usage counters plan allowance and API billing\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-007\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Denied tool call does not change exit code\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter002-001\",\"source\":\"f-iter002-001\",\"target\":\"q-angle2\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter002-002\",\"source\":\"f-iter002-004\",\"target\":\"q-angle2\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter002-003\",\"source\":\"f-iter002-005\",\"target\":\"q-angle2\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter002-004\",\"source\":\"f-iter002-007\",\"target\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Authentication resolves in order: the run's session credential, the provider's environment variable, the OS keyring, then the CLI OIDC session.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/utils/api_keys.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-002\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"A provider is a config object with api_base, api_key_env_var, api_style (default openai), backend (mistral or generic), reasoning_field_name and extra headers, so bring-your-own endpoint and key need no plugin.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/evidence/vibe-config-schema.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-003\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Models are a name-keyed map of ModelConfig with provider, alias, thinking and pricing fields, so an arbitrary id such as deepseek-v4-1-flash-1017 is pinnable only by adding a provider and model entry that names it.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/evidence/vibe-config-schema.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-004\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"allowed_models is an explicit allowlist supporting glob patterns and re: regex, with an empty list allowing every configured model.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/evidence/vibe-config-schema.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-005\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Reasoning effort is the six-level ladder off, low, medium, high, xhigh, max, but there is no headless CLI flag; it is set per session through the app server or statically through a model's thinking config.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/protocol.py\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/evidence/vibe-config-schema.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-006\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Two usage counters exist: the Mistral plan's monthly Vibe Code allowance with optional pay-as-you-go overflow, and ordinary per-token API billing from each model's input, output and cached-input prices.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_billing.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-007\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"A denied tool call is returned to the model as a tool error so the turn keeps going, so a denial does not change the process exit code.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_unified_permissions.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Looking for a --reasoning-effort CLI flag\",\"reason\":\"The Rust flag table has no such flag and every Python reasoning_effort call site is protocol or config level.\",\"iteration\":2}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Assuming the built-in catalog can name an OpenCode model id\",\"reason\":\"The catalog is Mistral's, so a foreign id requires a provider and model entry.\",\"iteration\":2}\n{\"type\":\"observation\",\"id\":\"obs-iter002-001\",\"packet\":\"angle-2\",\"classification\":\"real\",\"iteration\":2}\n{\"type\":\"invariant\",\"id\":\"inv-iter002-001\",\"label\":\"A governed cli-mistral-vibe mode must set VIBE_HOME and the provider key through the environment, because the default path reads the operator keyring and writes the operator home.\",\"iteration\":2}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-002.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-002.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-002.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"run\\\":2,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 2: providers, models and the subscription\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":7,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":1.0,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"All 7 findings are new: the auth resolution order, the provider/model config surface, the allowed_models roster, the thinking ladder without a CLI flag, the two usage counters and the denial semantics had no prior packet record.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"How does Vibe authenticate (browser sign-in, API key, bring-your-own key), can a dispatch pin deepseek-v4-1-flash-1017 and zai-glm-5-3-flash, how is reasoning effort set, and which usage