les/_harness_manager.py:128:        root-level discovery; cwd preserves walk-up semantics for AGENTS.md).\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py:225:        path = VIBE_HOME.path / AGENTS_MD_FILENAME\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py:232:    def _collect_agents_md(\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py:235:        \"\"\"Walk up from start toward stop, collecting non-empty AGENTS.md files.\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py:249:            path = current / AGENTS_MD_FILENAME\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py:265:    def find_subdirectory_agents_md(self, file_path: Path) -> list[tuple[Path, str]]:\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py:266:        \"\"\"Find AGENTS.md files between file_path's parent and its containing\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py:280:                return self._collect_agents_md(start, root, stop_inclusive=False)\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py:284:        \"\"\"Collect AGENTS.md files from each open project root up to its trust\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py:298:            for d, content in self._collect_age