{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659585941,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","part":{"partID":"prt_1da0c05dd001BCmWEmwtQr2qGp","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","messageID":"msg_1da0bf927001z1CkRdNi85XXE3","type":"tool","id":"0i0vt44p0","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"run\":3,\"runId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 3: configuration and the repo-local runtime folder\",\"findingsCount\":7,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All 7 findings are new: the project config walk-up and trust gate, the root-only local directory set, the global home layout, the AGENTS.md collection rules, the agent profile schema, the plugin manifest and the repo mirror contract had no prior packet record.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and from ~/.vibe/ (agents as TOML, AGENTS.md, project config), what would a repo-root .vibe/ folder contain, and which parts should be generated mirrors of .skilled/ sources?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and from ~/.vibe/ (agents as TOML, AGENTS.md, project config), what would a repo-root .vibe/ folder contain, and which parts should be generated mirrors of .skilled/ sources?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Assuming Vibe reads a repo-root config file by default\",\"Assuming .vibe/ is recursive like .opencode/\"],\"focusTrack\":\"configuration-surface\",\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Write\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packa