{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659746706,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","part":{"partID":"prt_1da0e7b78002QzcpI0sxJWltfS","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","messageID":"msg_1da0e6afa001RnZEyBp8Czpkdc","type":"tool","id":"za1ljq65w","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":4,\"run\":4,\"runId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 4: feature parity with cli-opencode\",\"findingsCount\":12,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All 12 findings are new: the 13-row parity table had no prior packet record, and each row names a Vibe mechanism (declarative plugins, strict hooks, closed slash-command set, TOML agents, Agent Skills metadata, run_typescript) not previously documented here.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"For each OpenCode surface this repository uses (plugins, spec gate, dispatch preflight hooks, session-relaunch loop, goal and context bridges, slash commands, custom agents, skills, MCP and Code Mode, permissions, self-invocation guard), does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial one or none, and what porting would it take?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"For each OpenCode surface this repository uses (plugins, spec gate, dispatch preflight hooks, session-relaunch loop, goal and context bridges, slash commands, custom agents, skills, MCP and Code Mode, permissions, self-invocation guard), does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial one or none, and what porting would it take?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Treating Vibe plugins as an OpenCode plugin port target\",\"Assuming slash commands port one-to-one\"],\"focusTrack\":\"opencode-parity\",\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Write\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".opencode/plugins\",\".opencode/hooks\",\".opencode/commands\",\".opencode/agents\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/plugins/_catalog.py\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/commands/registry.py\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/mistralai_vibe_local_harness/session_api/app_server/session/models/configuration.py\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-14T12:35:37Z\",\"durationMs\":161000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-angle4\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Feature parity with cli-opencode\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-001\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Plugins are declarative bundles not event handlers\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-002\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Strict pre_tool hooks can express the spec gate\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-003\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Dispatch preflight maps to pre_tool and pre_agent hooks\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-004\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Session relaunch becomes an outer driver\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-005\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"No goal object in Vibe\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-006\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Context bridge is protocol-only\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-007\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Slash commands are ten builtins plus skills\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-008\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Custom agents are TOML profiles\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-009\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Skills use the Agent Skills frontmatter\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-010\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"MCP and Code Mode both have equivalents\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-011\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Permissions are per-tool plus safety levels\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-012\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Self-invocation guard needs a hook\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter004-001\",\"source\":\"f-iter004-001\",\"target\":\"q-angle4\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter004-002\",\"source\":\"f-iter004-007\",\"target\":\"q-angle4\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter004-003\",\"source\":\"f-iter004-010\",\"target\":\"q-angle4\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter004-004\",\"source\":\"f-iter004-005\",\"target\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"relation\":\"CONTRADICTS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"OpenCode plugins are JS event handlers while Vibe plugins are declarative plugin.json bundles contributing skills, MCP servers, connectors and hooks, so plugin parity is partial and the 24 repo plugins must be reclassified into hooks or skills.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/plugins/_catalog.py\",\".opencode/plugins\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-002\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"A strict pre_tool hook can block a tool call, which is the mechanism needed to express the repository spec gate.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-003\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Dispatch preflight hooks map onto pre_tool and pre_agent strict hooks with a 60 second default timeout.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-004\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"The session-relaunch loop has no in-session hook equivalent; it becomes an outer driver over --continue, --resume, session/fork and --worktree.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-005\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Vibe has no goal object, goal file or prompt-rewriting hook, so the goal bridge has no equivalent and the goal must ride in AGENTS.md or prompt text.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-006\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"Session history is reachable only through the app-server protocol methods session/history/list, session/history/get and session/turns/list, not through a CLI dispatch.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/protocol.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-007\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Vibe slash commands are a closed builtin set of help, compact, reload, log, mcp, proxy-setup, retry, leanstall, unleanstall and data-retention, plus user-invocable skills; there is no user-authored command file format.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/commands/registry.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-008\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Custom agents are TOML profiles with name, description, safety, agent_type, overrides and instructions, an equivalent of the markdown personas with a different serialization.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/agents/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-009\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Vibe skills use the Agent Skills frontmatter (name, description, license, compatibility, metadata, allowed-tools, disable-model-invocation), matching the repository SKILL.md files.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-010\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"MCP is a first-class config surface and Code Mode has a direct analogue: programmatic_tool_calling defaults on and exposes run_typescript, search_tool_functions and a tools group catalog.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/mistralai_vibe_local_harness/session_api/app_server/session/models/configuration.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-011\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Permissions are expressed as agent safety levels plus per-tool config blocks, an outside_workdir ask-or-deny policy, path grants and a global bypass flag, so the OpenCode matrix translates but does not map one-to-one.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/permissions.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-012\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"There is no built-in self-invocation guard; a strict pre_tool hook that inspects the command line can express one.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating Vibe plugins as an OpenCode plugin port target\",\"reason\":\"A plugin.json bundle cannot run arbitrary code on runtime events, so the JS plugins must be reclassified into hooks and skills.\",\"iteration\":4}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Assuming slash commands port one-to-one\",\"reason\":\"Vibe has no user-authored command file format; commands become skills with a different invocation contract.\",\"iteration\":4}\n{\"type\":\"observation\",\"id\":\"obs-iter004-001\",\"packet\":\"angle-4\",\"classification\":\"real\",\"iteration\":4}\n{\"type\":\"invariant\",\"id\":\"inv-iter004-001\",\"label\":\"Any cli-mistral-vibe port must treat the goal bridge and the self-invocation guard as new work, because neither has a Vibe mechanism to extend.\",\"iteration\":4}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"run\\\":4,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"A