{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659924724,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","part":{"partID":"prt_1da11280b002VXYkRw8qydPgA7","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","messageID":"msg_1da111988001uSRf62mKsMnXAd","type":"tool","id":"xq1qnfif8","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":6,\"run\":6,\"runId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 6: hooks and safety\",\"findingsCount\":9,\"newInfoRatio\":0.94,\"noveltyJustification\":\"8 of 9 findings are new (event set, strict subset, sources and protocols, host timing, sandbox and permission layers, guard mapping); 1 is partially new because it corrects the iteration-4 goal-bridge row.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"What hook system does Vibe expose, at which events, can a hook block a tool call, can the eight repo guards the DeepSeek Harness plugin carries be expressed there, and what are Vibe's approval and sandbox modes?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What hook system does Vibe expose, at which events, can a hook block a tool call, can the eight repo guards the DeepSeek Harness plugin carries be expressed there, and what are Vibe's approval and sandbox modes?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Expressing completion-evidence or ask-surface-guard as Vibe hooks\",\"Assuming strict works on every hook type\"],\"focusTrack\":\"hooks-and-safety\",\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Write\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/config.py\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_host_hooks.py\",\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/mistralai_vibe_local_harness/session_api/app_server/session/models/configuration.py\",\".dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-14T12:38:33Z\",\"durationMs\":104000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-angle6\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Hooks and safety\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-001\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Seven hook events\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-002\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Strict blocking limited to three events\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-003\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Hook TOML shape and six sources\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-004\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"claude_code hook protocol is the porting lever\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-005\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Host hook timing and additional_context injection\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-006\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Sandbox and permission layers\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-007\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Four of seven DSH event classes have a Vibe home\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-008\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Deny-capable guards map to strict pre_tool\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-009\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Goal bridge is partial via session_start context\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter006-001\",\"source\":\"f-iter006-002\",\"target\":\"q-angle6\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter006-002\",\"source\":\"f-iter006-007\",\"target\":\"q-angle6\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter006-003\",\"source\":\"f-iter006-009\",\"target\":\"f-iter004-005\",\"relation\":\"SUPERSEDES\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter006-004\",\"source\":\"f-iter006-004\",\"target\":\"f-iter004-002\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Vibe fires seven hook events: pre_agent, post_agent, pre_tool, post_tool, notification, session_start and session_end.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-002\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"strict is accepted only on pre_tool, post_tool and pre_agent, so a hook can block a tool call but not a notification or a session boundary.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-003\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"A hook is TOML with name, type, command, match, timeout defaulting to 60 seconds, strict and description, drawn from six sources and speaking the vibe, claude_code or kimi_code protocol.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-004\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"The claude_code hook protocol means an existing Claude Code hook configuration can be consumed as-is, which is the cheapest porting path for a guard set.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-005\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"notification and session_end run in the background with output ignored, while session_start runs synchronously and its additional_context is added to the next user message, which waits for the hook; close waits at most five seconds.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_host_hooks.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-006\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Safety is two layers: SandboxConfig with type local or managed plus SandboxAccess none, files or full, and PermissionRule rows matching stable tool IDs by glob with a behaviour.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/mistralai_vibe_local_harness/session_api/app_server/session/models/configuration.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-007\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Vibe can host four of the seven DSH event classes: tools/pre-execute to pre_tool, tools/post-execute to post_tool, agent/created to session_start and agent/disposed to session_end; agent/pre-step, agent/turn-stopping and session/event compaction have no home.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-008\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"The deny-capable guards spec-gate-enforce, env-secret-guard, overlay-guard, mcp-route-guard, dispatch-preflight-lint and git-message-gate all become strict pre_tool hooks, while completion-evidence and ask-surface-guard cannot be expressed.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-009\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Correction to iteration 4: the goal bridge is partial, not absent, because a session_start hook can return additional_context injected into the next user message through the builtin session_start_context pre_agent binding; what is missing is a goal object with lifecycle.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_host_hooks.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Expressing completion-evidence or ask-surface-guard as Vibe hooks\",\"reason\":\"Both bind to a turn-stopping moment Vibe does not expose.\",\"iteration\":6}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Assuming strict works on every hook type\",\"reason\":\"The validator rejects strict outside pre_tool, post_tool and pre_agent.\",\"iteration\":6}\n{\"type\":\"observation\",\"id\":\"obs-iter006-001\",\"packet\":\"angle-6\",\"classification\":\"real\",\"iteration\":6}\n{\"type\":\"invariant\",\"id\":\"inv-iter006-001\",\"label\":\"A Vibe guard design may rely on blocking only at pre_tool, post_tool and pre_agent; any guard that needs a turn-stopping veto must live outside the hook system.\",\"iteration\":6}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"run\\\":6,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 6: hooks and safety\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":9,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.94,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"8 of 9 findings are new (event set, strict subset, sources and protocols, host timing, sandbox and permission layers, guard mapping); 1 is partially new because it corrects the iteration-4 goal-bridge row.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"What hook system does Vibe expose, at which events, can a hook block a tool call, can the eight repo guards the DeepSeek Harness plugin carries be expressed there, and what are Vibe's approval and sandbox modes?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"What hook system does Vibe expose, at which events, can a hook block a tool call, can the eight repo guards the DeepSeek Harness plugin carries be expressed there, and what are Vibe's approval and sandbox modes?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Expressing completion-evidence or ask-surface-guard as Vibe hooks\\\",\\\"Assuming strict works on every hook type\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"hooks-and-safety\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"contradictory-evidence\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"Write\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\\\",\\\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/config.py\\\",\\\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_host_hooks.py\\\",\\\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/mistralai_vibe_local_harness/session_api/app_server/session/models/configuration.py\\\",\\\".dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-14T12:38:33Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":104000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"q-angle6\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"QUESTION\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Hooks and safety\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter006-001\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\