{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794660043532,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","part":{"partID":"prt_1da12fd37001wlmhtLXupG6naV","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","messageID":"msg_1da12f06d0018PnxVz4mzLFbfy","type":"tool","id":"ns0za5aru","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":7,\"run\":7,\"runId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 7: deep-loop executor support\",\"findingsCount\":9,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All 9 findings are new: the three executor tables, the per-kind flag enforcement, the roster pattern, the adapter contract, the fail-closed sandbox rule, the three-layer env allowlist, the recursion guard and the stress and branch-contract coverage had no prior packet record.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe executor kind need in the deep-loop runtime: the command builder, the environment allowlist, a closed model roster, dispatch-audit recognition and stress coverage?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe executor kind need in the deep-loop runtime: the command builder, the environment allowlist, a closed model roster, dispatch-audit recognition and stress coverage?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Declaring reasoningEffort for cli-mistral-vibe\",\"Reusing the cli-opencode adapter with a different binary\"],\"focusTrack\":\"deep-loop-executor\",\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Write\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/executor-branch-contract.vitest.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/stress/cli-adapter\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/SKILL.md\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-14T12:40:33Z\",\"durationMs\":120000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-angle7\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Deep-loop executor support\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-001\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Closed kind tuple and three tables\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-002\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Per-kind flag enforcement excludes reasoningEffort\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-003\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Closed model roster pattern\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-004\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Frozen adapter map and five-step adapter\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-005\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"finalizeLineageCommand fails closed on sandbox\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-006\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Three-layer env allowlist needs MISTRAL_API_KEY\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-007\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Dispatch audit and recursion guard\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-008\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Stress and branch-contract coverage\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-009\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Inline YAML branches only for four kinds\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter007-001\",\"source\":\"f-iter007-001\",\"target\":\"q-angle7\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter007-002\",\"source\":\"f-iter007-006\",\"target\":\"q-angle7\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter007-003\",\"source\":\"f-iter007-008\",\"target\":\"q-angle7\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter007-004\",\"source\":\"f-iter007-002\",\"target\":\"f-iter002-005\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"EXECUTOR_KINDS is a closed eight-entry tuple, and adding a kind means editing the tuple, EXECUTOR_KIND_FLAG_SUPPORT and EXECUTOR_PREVENTIVE_SANDBOX_CAPABILITY together.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-002\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Flag support is per-kind and enforced by an unsupported-field scan; cli-mistral-vibe should declare model, timeoutSeconds and liveTools and must not declare reasoningEffort because Vibe has no such flag.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-003\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"A closed model roster is a module-level constant plus a predicate plus a default, as PI_SUPPORTED_MODELS and isPiSupportedModel show; cli-mistral-vibe needs the same trio.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-004\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"The command builder is a frozen LINEAGE_COMMAND_ADAPTERS map that throws on an unknown kind, and every adapter follows preflight, roster check, provider mapping, argument assembly, then finalizeLineageCommand.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-005\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"finalizeLineageCommand builds effectiveConfig and an invocationFingerprint and fails closed when a kind cannot honor a sandbox mode, as cli-opencode does for anything but danger-full-access.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-006\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"The env allowlist has a common set, per-kind exact keys and per-kind prefixes; cli-mistral-vibe needs the VIBE_ prefix plus MISTRAL_API_KEY as an explicit key because that name carries no VIBE_ prefix.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-007\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"runAuditedExecutorCommand validates against the recursion guard, writes INTENT and COMPLETION receipts and spawns with the filtered env; the guard matches executable basenames through an ancestor walk, so both vibe and vibe-rs must be recognised.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-008\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"Each kind needs a stress file under tests/stress/cli-adapter plus live-contracts and matrix-manifest entries, and executor-branch-contract.vitest.ts fails the build when a non-native kind has no if_cli_ branch in all four deep-loop YAMLs.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/executor-branch-contract.vitest.ts\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-009\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"The inline research YAML carries branches only for native, cli-claude-code, cli-opencode and cli-codex, so cli-mistral-vibe needs either a new inline branch or the documented fan-out-only path.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/SKILL.md\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Declaring reasoningEffort for cli-mistral-vibe\",\"reason\":\"Vibe has no reasoning-effort CLI flag and the unsupported-field scan would reject the field.\",\"iteration\":7}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Reusing the cli-opencode adapter with a different binary\",\"reason\":\"The argument grammar differs on prompt delivery, output format, approval flags and limits.\",\"iteration\":7}\n{\"type\":\"observation\",\"id\":\"obs-iter007-001\",\"packet\":\"angle-7\",\"classification\":\"real\",\"iteration\":7}\n{\"type\":\"invariant\",\"id\":\"inv-iter007-001\",\"label\":\"A new executor kind must fail closed on any sandbox mode it cannot enforce, never downgrade with an advisory label.\",\"iteration\":7}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"run\\\":7,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-mistral-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 7: deep-loop executor support\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":9,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":1.0,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"All 9 findings are new: the three executor tables, the per-kind flag enforcement, the roster pattern, the adapter contract, the fail-closed sandbox rule, the three-layer env allowlist, the recursion guard and the stress and branch-contract coverage had no prior packet record.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe executor kind need in the deep-loop runtime: the command builder, the environment allowlist, a closed model roster, dispatch-audit recognition and stress coverage?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe executor kind need in the deep-loop runtime: the command builder, the environment allowlist, a closed model roster, dispatch-audit recognition and stress coverage?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Declaring reasoningEffort for cli-mistral-vibe\\\",\\\"Reusing the cli-opencode adapter with a different binary\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"deep-loop-executor\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"partial-success\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"Write\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/executor-branch-contract.vitest.ts\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/stress/cli-adapter\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/SKILL.md\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-14T12:40:33Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":120000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"q-angle7\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"QUESTION\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Deep-loop executor support\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-001\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Closed kind tuple and three tables\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-002\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Per-kind flag enforcement excludes reasoningEffort\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-003\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Closed model roster pattern\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-004\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Frozen adapter map and five-step adapter\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-005\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"finalizeLineageCommand fails closed on sandbox\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-006\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Three-layer env allowlist needs MISTRAL_API_KEY\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-007\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Dispatch audit and recursion guard\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-008\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Stress and branch-contract coverage\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-009\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Inline YAML branches only for four kinds\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-iter007-001\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-iter007-001\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-angle7\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"ANSWERS\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-iter007-002\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-iter007-006\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-angle7\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"ANSWERS\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-iter007-003\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-iter007-008\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-angle7\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"ANSWERS\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-iter007-004\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-iter007-002\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"f-iter002-005\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"SUPPORTS\\\"}]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-001\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"EXECUTOR_KINDS is a closed eight-entry tuple, and adding a kind means editing the tuple, EXECUTOR_KIND_FLAG_SUPPORT and EXECUTOR_PREVENTIVE_SANDBOX_CAPABILITY together.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-002\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Flag support is per-kind and enforced by an unsupported-field scan; cli-mistral-vibe should declare model, timeoutSeconds and liveTools and must not declare reasoningEffort because Vibe has no such flag.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-003\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"A closed model roster is a module-level constant plus a predicate plus a default, as PI_SUPPORTED_MODELS and isPiSupportedModel show; cli-mistral-vibe needs the same trio.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-004\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The command builder is a frozen LINEAGE_COMMAND_ADAPTERS map that throws on an unknown kind, and every adapter follows preflight, roster check, provider mapping, argument assembly, then finalizeLineageCommand.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-005\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"finalizeLineageCommand builds effectiveConfig and an invocationFingerprint and fails closed when a kind cannot honor a sandbox mode, as cli-opencode does for anything but danger-full-access.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-006\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The env allowlist has a common set, per-kind exact keys and per-kind prefixes; cli-mistral-vibe needs the VIBE_ prefix plus MISTRAL_API_KEY as an explicit key because that name carries no VIBE_ prefix.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-007\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"runAuditedExecutorCommand validates against the recursion guard, writes INTENT and COMPLETION receipts and spawns with the filtered env; the guard matches executable basenames through an ancestor walk, so both vibe and vibe-rs must be recognised.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-008\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Each kind needs a stress file under tests/stress/cli-adapter plus live-contracts and matrix-manifest entries, and executor-branch-contract.vitest.ts fails the build when a non-native kind has no if_cli_ branch in all four deep-loop YAMLs.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/executor-branch-contract.vitest.ts\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter007-009\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The inline research YAML carries branches only for native, cli-claude-code, cli-opencode and cli-codex, so cli-mistral-vibe needs either a new inline branch or the documented fan-out-only path.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/SKILL.md\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Declaring reasoningEffort for cli-mistral-vibe\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Vibe has no reasoning-effort CLI flag and the unsupported-field scan would reject the field.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Reusing the cli-opencode adapter with a different binary\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The argument grammar differs on prompt delivery, output format, approval flags and limits.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"observation\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs-iter007-001\\\",\\\"packet\\\":\\\"angle-7\\\",\\\"classification\\\":\\\"real\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"invariant\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"inv-iter007-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"A new executor kind must fail closed on any sandbox mode it cannot enforce, never downgrade with an advisory label.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794660039991,"end":1794660043532}}}}
