{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794660224564,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","part":{"partID":"prt_1da15cde7001bOD65s25iHRr1L","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","messageID":"msg_1da15be4f001fTZoVKGm5Oiznx","type":"tool","id":"sq10emocg","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek && echo \"=== research.md size ===\"; wc -l research.md; echo \"=== tail ===\"; tail -20 research.md; echo \"=== dashboard head ===\"; head -20 deep-research-dashboard.md"},"output":"=== research.md size ===\n     324 research.md\n=== tail ===\n\n| Deliverable | Location | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| Iteration narratives | `iterations/iteration-001.md` … `iteration-008.md` | 8 written |\n| Structured deltas | `deltas/iter-001.jsonl` … `iter-008.jsonl` | 8 written |\n| Canonical state log | `deep-research-state.jsonl` | gateway-owned, 8 iteration records |\n| Strategy | `deep-research-strategy.md` | reducer-owned |\n| Registry and dashboard | `findings-registry.json`, `deep-research-dashboard.md` | reducer-owned |\n| Resource map | `resource-map.md` | generated |\n| Merged synthesis | `research.md` | this file |\n| Captured evidence | `evidence/vibe-config-schema.json`, `scratch/smoke1/` | captured |\n\n---\n\n## 17. Handoff Notes for the Parent Merge\n\n- **The parity table in §6 supersedes the iteration-4 table** where they disagree: the goal-bridge row moved from \"None\" to \"Partial\" after iteration 6 found the `session_start` `additional_context` path.\n- **`research/phase-plan.md` is not written by this lineage** because it lives outside the lineage write surface. §11's ranked build phases are the content that file should carry.\n- **The four highest-value next actions** are: capture `vibe config schema` into the runtime packet as a checked artifact; write the `.vibe/` mirror; author the six deny-capable hooks; and spend one authenticated dispatch to close open questions 1, 2 and 3 at once.\n- **Do not treat \"8 of 8 answered\" as \"8 of 8 verified.\"** The questions are answered from primary sources; the success path was never exercised.\n=== dashboard head ===\n---\ntitle: Deep Research Dashboard\ndescription: Auto-generated reducer view over the research packet.\n---\n\n# Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview\n\nAuto-generated from JSONL state log, iteration files, findings registry, and strategy state. Never manually edited.\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:overview -->\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nReducer-generated observability surface for the active research packet.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:overview -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:status -->\n## 2. STATUS\n- Topic: Mistral Vibe (vibe 3.1.2, installed) as a governed cli-external-orchestration runtime mode, and feature parity of its extensions, hooks, plugins, skills, commands and agents with cli-opencode\n- Started: 2026-11-14T12:25:15Z\n- Status: COMPLETE\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== research.md size ===\n     324 research.md\n=== tail ===\n\n| Deliverable | Location | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| Iteration narratives | `iterations/iteration-001.md` … `iteration-008.md` | 8 written |\n| Structured deltas | `deltas/iter-001.jsonl` … `iter-008.jsonl` | 8 written |\n| Canonical state log | `deep-research-state.jsonl` | gateway-owned, 8 iteration records |\n| Strategy | `deep-research-strategy.md` | reducer-owned |\n| Registry and dashboard | `findings-registry.json`, `deep-research-dashboard.md` | reducer-owned |\n| Resource map | `resource-map.md` | generated |\n| Merged synthesis | `research.md` | this file |\n| Captured evidence | `evidence/vibe-config-schema.json`, `scratch/smoke1/` | captured |\n\n---\n\n## 17. Handoff Notes for the Parent Merge\n\n- **The parity table in §6 supersedes the iteration-4 table** where they disagree: the goal-bridge row moved from \"None\" to \"Partial\" after iteration 6 found the `session_start` `additional_context` path.\n- **`research/phase-plan.md` is not written by this lineage** because it lives outside the lineage write surface. §11's ranked build phases are the content that file should carry.\n- **The four highest-value next actions** are: capture `vibe config schema` into the runtime packet as a checked artifact; write the `.vibe/` mirror; author the six deny-capable hooks; and spend one authenticated dispatch to close open questions 1, 2 and 3 at once.\n- **Do not treat \"8 of 8 answered\" as \"8 of 8 verified.\"** The questions are answered from primary sources; the success path was never exercised.\n=== dashboard head ===\n---\ntitle: Deep Research Dashboard\ndescription: Auto-generated reducer view over the research packet.\n---\n\n# Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview\n\nAuto-generated from JSONL state log, iteration files, findings registry, and strategy state. Never manually edited.\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:overview -->\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nReducer-generated observability surface for the active research packet.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:overview -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:status -->\n## 2. STATUS\n- Topic: Mistral Vibe (vibe 3.1.2, installed) as a governed cli-external-orchestration runtime mode, and feature parity of its extensions, hooks, plugins, skills, commands and agents with cli-opencode\n- Started: 2026-11-14T12:25:15Z\n- Status: COMPLETE\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek && echo \\\"=== research.md size ===\\\"; wc -l research.md; echo \\\"=== tail ===\\\"; tail -20 research.md; echo \\\"=== dashboard head ===\\\"; head -20 deep-research-dashboard.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794660224487,"end":1794660224564}}}}
