{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794660234603,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","part":{"partID":"prt_1da15f182001tnQWevwIdOJVBZ","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d9ffevqO0j4AcG7O1MF","messageID":"msg_1da15dfbd001cpH0L37tWH7dyu","type":"tool","id":"hj1vo6byt","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled && echo \"=== strategy answered ===\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:answered-questions/,/\\/ANCHOR:answered-questions/p' specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek/deep-research-strategy.md | head -20; echo \"=== git status (outside lineage) ===\"; git status --porcelain | grep -v \"001-deep-research/research/lineages/mistral-deepseek\" | head -20"},"output":"=== strategy answered ===\n<!-- ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n## 6. ANSWERED QUESTIONS\n- How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: prompt as argument, stdin or file, which flags set model, agent profile, permissions, working directory and turn or time limits, what lands on stdout and stderr, and what are the exit codes on success, provider error, denied tool and timeout?\n- How does Vibe authenticate (browser sign-in, API key, bring-your-own key), can a dispatch pin deepseek-v4-1-flash-1017 and zai-glm-5-3-flash, how is reasoning effort set, and which usage counter does a Vibe turn draw on?\n- What does Vibe read from the working directory and from ~/.vibe/ (agents as TOML, AGENTS.md, project config), what would a repo-root .vibe/ folder contain, and which parts should be generated mirrors of .skilled/ sources?\n- For each OpenCode surface this repository uses (plugins, spec gate, dispatch preflight hooks, session-relaunch loop, goal and context bridges, slash commands, custom agents, skills, MCP and Code Mode, permissions, self-invocation guard), does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial one or none, and what porting would it take?\n- What skill format does Vibe load and from where, and how do its slash-command skills and custom subagents map onto this repository's skills, commands and agent directories?\n- What hook system does Vibe expose, at which events, can a hook block a tool call, can the eight repo guards the DeepSeek Harness plugin carries be expressed there, and what are Vibe's approval and sandbox modes?\n- What would a cli-mistral-vibe executor kind need in the deep-loop runtime: the command builder, the environment allowlist, a closed model roster, dispatch-audit recognition and stress coverage?\n- Vibe speaks the Agent Client Protocol: is ACP a better dispatch surface than a print mode for this repository, and what would it change in the fan-out?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n=== git status (outside lineage) ===\n M .github/workflows/README.md\n M .github/workflows/opencode-dual-version.yml\n M .pi/settings.json\n M .skilled/CROSS-CLI.md\n M .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/opencode-version-battery.cjs\n M .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/opencode-version-battery.test.cjs\n M .skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib/dispatch-rule-checks.mjs\n M .skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib/dispatch-rule-checks.test.mjs\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/README.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/SKILL.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/README.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/SKILL.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/hard-rules.json\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/references/providers-and-models.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/references/runtime-folder-and-sync.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/README.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/SKILL.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/references/cli-reference.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-exte