cognition and stress coverage?\n- Vibe speaks the Agent Client Protocol: is ACP a better dispatch surface than a print mode for this repository, and what would it change in the fan-out?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n=== git status (outside lineage) ===\n M .github/workflows/README.md\n M .github/workflows/opencode-dual-version.yml\n M .pi/settings.json\n M .skilled/CROSS-CLI.md\n M .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/opencode-version-battery.cjs\n M .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/opencode-version-battery.test.cjs\n M .skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib/dispatch-rule-checks.mjs\n M .skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib/dispatch-rule-checks.test.mjs\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/README.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/SKILL.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/README.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/SKILL.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/hard-rules.json\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/references/providers-and-models.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/references/runtime-folder-and-sync.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/README.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/SKILL.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/references/cli-reference.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/references/install-and-versions.md\n M .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/references/providers-and-models.md\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled && echo \\\"=== strategy answered ===\\\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:answered-questions/,/\\\\/ANCHOR:answered-questions/p' specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/